OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhat weapon could the US have put into
OL,4,Aspace?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo what could this weapon be, and what
OL,7,Fis the wider picture like for military
OL,8,Fdevelopments in space? Who else could
OL,9,Fhave similar weaponry?
OL,11,FSpace has been a militarised domain
OL,12,Fsince the start of the space age - in
OL,13,Fthe late 1960s, the Soviet Union
OL,14,Fdeployed weapons up there. The
OL,15,FIstrebitel Sputnikov (IS; Satellite
OL,16,FDestroyer) programme was made up of
OL,17,Fsatellites that were designed to
OL,18,Frelease projectiles that detonated,
OL,19,Freleasing shrapnel into the path of
OL,20,Fanother (usually American) satellite.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
